flowchart LR
  pop[Report popover: reason + Turnstile] --> act[board.report]
  act --> rl{too many reports from this hash in an hour?}
  rl -->|yes| rate[RATE]
  rl -->|no| own{own note?}
  own -->|yes| okq[ok, not counted]
  own -->|no| cte[one statement: insert report, bump count, hide at threshold]
  cte --> hidden{hidden now?}
  hidden -->|yes| alert[Discord: crew number + reasons]
  hidden --> ok[always ok]
